OL,3,GNEWSA'Extremist' jailed for raping     
OL,4,Awoman in her home                      
OL,6,FDuring sentencing, His Honour Judge    
OL,7,FAmbrose told Al-Shammari it was the    
OL,8,Fwoman's right to say no, that it was   
OL,9,F"very clear" she did say no, but he    
OL,10,Fchose to continue.                     
